docs {
  # MTSS Sample Data > Associate Staff with Intervention Delivery - [PATH 2]
  
  Vendor actions behind the "Associate Staff with Intervention Delivery - [PATH 2]" certification steps (`bruno/MTSS/v5/intervention`).
  Run the Foundation first. Run each script, then the certification step it feeds.
  
  | Script | Feeds certification step |
  | --- | --- |
  | Step 1 | 01 - 1st Cohort is valid |
  | Step 2 | 02 - 1st StaffCohortAssociation is valid |
  | Step 3 | 03 - 2nd StaffCohortAssociation is valid |
  | Step 4 | 04 - 1st StudentInterventionAssociation - cohortReference was Updated |
  | Step 5 | 05 - 1st StaffCohortAssociation - endDate was Updated |
  | Step 6 | 06 - 2nd StaffCohortAssociation was Deleted |
}
